# Ask to change the email. Start the API with Aspire first.
@host = http://localhost:5279
@accessToken = paste-an-access-token

### A new address and the right password → 202. Another account uses it → 409 user.email_taken.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/email-changes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newEmail": "new-{{$guid}}@example.com",
  "currentPassword": "password"
}

### The wrong password → 400, the errors name the field.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/email-changes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newEmail": "new-{{$guid}}@example.com",
  "currentPassword": "wrong"
}
